Behaviour reproduced (no code copied)
  The image preprocessing reproduces, to the bit, the output of Hugging Face transformers'
  Gemma4ImageProcessor (Apache-2.0) with PyTorch/torchvision's antialiased bicubic uint8 resize
  (BSD-3-Clause), and the JPEG decoder reproduces libjpeg-turbo's default decoding
  (IJG and BSD-style licenses). The tokenizer follows the tokenizer.json format of Hugging Face
  tokenizers (Apache-2.0). These projects were used as references and to generate test data.
